OL,3,GNEWSATeacher spends night in school to
OL,4,Abuild Lego model
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school teacher is spending
OL,7,Fthe night in his school to build a Star
OL,8,FWars Lego model.
OL,10,FJoshua Jennings runs the Lego club at
OL,11,FRobert Miles Junior School in Bingham,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire.
OL,14,FThe school is currently trying to raise
OL,15,F#15,000 to rebuild playground equipment
OL,16,Ffor the children, and Jennings set
OL,17,Fhimself the overnight challenge to help
OL,18,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
