OL,3,GNEWSATeacher spends night in school to
OL,4,Abuild Lego model
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe began on Friday and expects it could
OL,7,Ftake up to 36 hours to finish the
OL,8,Fbuild, depending on naps, but said he
OL,9,Fwanted to show the children challenges
OL,10,Fcan also be enjoyable.
